  "title": {
   "en": "Ask to Unlock"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "물어서 잠금 해제"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"Senior, please drink my blood.\"\n\nHyunseung, who had never been caught as a vampire in his life, is exposed by Taehee, whom he met during a group project. Why did it have to be a vampire otaku who caught him, making it impossible to come up with an excuse?!\n\nTaehee, of course, promises to keep it a secret and bombards Hyunseung with questions about vampires. Hyunseung, barely holding onto his sanity, eventually agrees to help with Taehee's fandom... A symbiotic relationship where they share blood and fandom—could this really be okay?"
  },
